407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (The FG-04 is a compact, cost-effective, and intelligent 2/4/8 Zone Conventional Fire Alarm Control Panel designed to deliver reliable fire detection and alarm management for a wide range of commercial, industrial, and institutional applications. It supports conventional input devices while offering a comprehensive set of advanced features for efficient system operation and monitoring.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (The panel provides multiple notification and communication options, including Notification Appliance Circuits \(Hooters\), Voice Call, SMS, and HMS integration, ensuring that critical fire events are promptly communicated to the appropriate personnel. The system is fully field-programmable through both the front-panel keypad and the mobile application, enabling quick configuration, maintenance, and remote management.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
409 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (For enhanced system reliability, the FG-04 continuously supervises all field wiring, AC mains supply, and battery health. It also supports optional Ethernet and GSM communication modules, providing secure and reliable event transmission to remote monitoring stations.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (When configured in a Master/Slave network, the Master Panel can display complete event and status information from all connected slave panels, providing centralized control and monitoring across multiple locations.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
411 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (The FG-04 can also be seamlessly integrated with the HMS \(Health Monitoring System\), enabling centralized monitoring, real-time diagnostics, enhanced situational awareness, and efficient system management. This integration helps ensure continuous supervision of the fire alarm network while simplifying maintenance and improving overall operational reliability)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
412 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (With its intelligent features, flexible communication options, and scalable architecture, the FG-04 delivers a complete, reliable, and future-ready fire alarm solution for modern fire safety applications.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
